      "message": "You\u0027re updating the progress on every `\\r` chunk. This could cause a massive amount of updates for the same update progress (e.g. when only a few kilobytes are updating).\n\nSuggestion: Only update when the progress really changes. Draft (written without testing it):\n\n\n```cpp\nint progress{-1);\nint lastProgress{-1};\n\nif (progress \u003e\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 progress !\u003d lastProgress)\n{\n\tlastProgress \u003d progress;\n\tsetUpdateProgress(progress);\n}\n```",
      "revId": "8f3d9bd01f062241c105469353a19a2f5e0f63cb",
